	upgradeDescription(1)="Increase your <font color=\"#a0c1cb\">Health</font> by <font color=\"#15d7fa\">70%</font>. Also you are immune to <font color=\"#a0c1cb\">Camera Shake</font> and can't be <font color=\"#a0c1cb\">grabbed by Clots</font>."
